          "code": "CREATE_ACTIONS_LLM",
          "id": "1774498880198",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774498880200_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a product-configuration action builder.\n\nINPUTS\n\n1) User Rule Description (string):\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n2) Model Attributes & MenuItems (JSON):\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.attributes}}\n\nTASK\nExtract only the action logic from the User Rule Description.\nIgnore conditions/predicates (if/when/unless logic).\nChoose attribute(s) whose names most closely match the requested action.\nIf no action is described, return a Standard action with only actionType.\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn valid JSON only. No markdown. No commentary.\n\nOUTPUT SCHEMA\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"hidingAction\": {\n      \"attributes\": [<string>, ...]\n    },\n    \"messageAction\": {\n      \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n      \"messageLevel\": <\"Info\" | \"Error\">,\n      \"staticMessage\": <string | null>\n    },\n    \"constraintAction\": {\n      \"constraints\": {\n        \"items\": [\n          {\n            \"attribute\": <string>,\n            \"value\": {\n              \"constrainAll\": <boolean>,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"constraintBehavior\": <\"Allow\" | \"Constrain\">,\n              \"constraintValueDisplayOverride\": \"NoOverride\",\n              \"values\": [<string>, ...],\n              \"operator\": <string>,\n              \"rangeOperator\": <string>,\n              \"rangeValue\": <string>\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": <string | null>\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"recommendationAction\": {\n      \"recommendations\": {\n        \"items\": [\n          {\n            \"attribute\": <string>,\n            \"value\": {\n              \"setType\": <\"None\" | \"Set\" | \"ForcedSet\">,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [<string>, ...]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": <string | null>\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nRULES\n\nA) Wrapper and exclusivity\n- Always output: \"action\": { \"actionType\": \"Standard\", ... }.\n- Include exactly one of: hidingAction, constraintAction, recommendationAction, messageAction.\n- Omit all unused action types entirely.\n\nB) Dominant action selection (single output type only)\n- If multiple action types appear, choose by priority:\n  constraintAction > hidingAction > recommendationAction > messageAction\n\nC) Hiding action\n- Output:\n  \"hidingAction\": { \"attributes\": [<attrVar>, ...] }\n- Attributes must exist in provided attributes list.\n- Do not duplicate attributes.\n\nD) Message action\n- Use only for standalone user-facing text action.\n- \"messageType\" = \"Simple\".\n- \"messageLevel\" = \"Error\" only if user explicitly indicates error; else \"Info\".\n- If user provides explicit message text, use that exact text.\n- If user requests a message but provides no text, generate a concise intent-based message.\n- \"staticMessage\" rules:\n  - Set to null only when no message is requested.\n  - Otherwise set to a non-null string.\n  - Non-null message text must include quote characters around the message content.\n    Example JSON value: \"\\\"Color was set to blue based on your rule.\\\"\"\n\nE) Constraint action\n- Use when limiting/allowing/disallowing values.\n- Per item:\n  - \"attribute\" must be valid.\n  - Always include \"message\" with:\n    { \"messageType\": \"Simple\", \"staticMessage\": <string|null> }.\n\n- Value rules:\n  1. constrainAll = true\n     - Include:\n       \"constrainAll\": true, \"valueType\": \"Simple\", \"values\": []\n     - Omit operator, rangeOperator, rangeValue.\n  2. constrainAll = false\n     - Must include relevant constraints.\n\n- By attribute/input type:\n  1. SingleSelectMenu / MultiSelectMenu\n     - Include:\n       \"constraintBehavior\" (\"Allow\" or \"Constrain\")\n       \"constraintValueDisplayOverride\": \"NoOverride\"\n       \"values\": [...]\n     - Do NOT include operator/rangeOperator/rangeValue.\n  2. TextField with dataType Text\n     - \"operator\": \"EqualTo\"\n     - \"values\": [strings...]\n     - Do NOT include constraintBehavior/constraintValueDisplayOverride/range fields.\n  3. TextField with Integer/Float, Date, Currency, Boolean\n     - Values must be strings (including booleans: \"true\"/\"false\").\n     - Boolean uses only \"EqualTo\".\n     - Allowed operators by type:\n       - Number/Currency: LessThan, LessThanEqualTo, EqualTo, NotEqualTo, GreaterThan, GreaterThanEqualTo, Between\n       - Date: EqualTo, NotEqualTo, Before, OnOrBefore, After, OnOrAfter, Between\n       - Boolean: EqualTo\n\n- Between encoding (strict):\n  - Use one constraint item:\n    - \"operator\" = lower-bound comparator\n    - \"values\" = [lowerBoundString]\n    - \"rangeOperator\" = upper-bound comparator\n    - \"rangeValue\" = upperBoundString (singular string, not array)\n  - Omit rangeOperator/rangeValue for non-Between cases.\n\n- Message rule (strict):\n  - If user explicitly provides message text, use that exact text.\n  - If user requests a message but gives no text, generate concise intent-based text.\n  - If user does not request any message, set staticMessage to null.\n  - If staticMessage is non-null, include quote characters around message content.\n    Example JSON value: \"\\\"Only beige and black interiors are allowed.\\\"\"\n\n- If inputTypeCode unsupported: do not constrain that attribute.\n\nF) Recommendation action\n- Use when suggesting/pre-filling values.\n- Per item:\n  - \"attribute\" valid\n  - \"valueType\": \"Simple\"\n  - \"setType\":\n    - \"None\" by default\n    - \"Set\" only if explicitly requested\n    - \"ForcedSet\" only if explicitly requested\n  - \"values\": recommended values as strings\n  - Always include:\n    { \"messageType\": \"Simple\", \"staticMessage\": <string|null> }\n\n- STRICT PROHIBITIONS for recommendation value object:\n  - Never include \"operator\"\n  - Never include \"rangeOperator\"\n  - Never include \"rangeValue\"\n  - Never include constraint-only fields (constraintBehavior, constrainAll, constraintValueDisplayOverride)\n\n- Message rule:\n  - If user explicitly provides message text, use that exact text.\n  - If user requests a message but gives no text, generate concise intent-based text.\n  - If user does not request any message, set staticMessage to null.\n  - If staticMessage is non-null, include quote characters around message content.\n    Example JSON value: \"\\\"Recommended values were applied.\\\"\"\n\nG) General validation\n- Attribute identifiers and selectable values must exactly match provided data (case-sensitive).\n- Preserve user capitalization in all output strings.\n- Do not invent attributes, values, operators, or messages except generated message text when message is requested but not provided.\n- Generated message text must be one short sentence, action-focused, and attribute-aware when possible.\n- Do not emit empty arrays except \"values\": [] when constrainAll is true.\n- Omit optional fields when not applicable.\n\nEXAMPLES\n\nExample 1 (Constraint action: menu allow + constrainAll + numeric + between with singular rangeValue + explicit message)\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"constraintAction\": {\n      \"constraints\": {\n        \"items\": [\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"vInterior\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"constrainAll\": false,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"constraintBehavior\": \"Allow\",\n              \"constraintValueDisplayOverride\": \"NoOverride\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"beige\",\n                \"black\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": \"\\\"Only beige and black interiors are allowed.\\\"\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"sPackages\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"constrainAll\": true,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": []\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": null\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"expenseLimit\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"constrainAll\": false,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"1234567.0000\"\n              ],\n              \"operator\": \"LessThanEqualTo\"\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": null\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"searchFlowDateField\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"constrainAll\": false,\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"2026-03-01 00:00:00\"\n              ],\n              \"operator\": \"OnOrAfter\",\n              \"rangeOperator\": \"OnOrBefore\",\n              \"rangeValue\": \"2026-03-31 00:00:00\"\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": \"\\\"Date must be in March 2026.\\\"\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nExample 2 (Recommendation action: NO operators/ranges, message captured when explicitly provided)\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"recommendationAction\": {\n      \"recommendations\": {\n        \"items\": [\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"searchFlowDateField\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"setType\": \"Set\",\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"2026-03-31 00:00:00\",\n                \"2026-03-30 00:00:00\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": \"\\\"The search flow date field should be March 30 or 31, 2026.\\\"\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"searchFlowIntegerMSM\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"setType\": \"ForcedSet\",\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"-1\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": null\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"sTBRFiltersAllPF\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"setType\": \"None\",\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"true\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": null\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nExample 3 (Recommendation action: message requested but text not provided; generated from intent)\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"recommendationAction\": {\n      \"recommendations\": {\n        \"items\": [\n          {\n            \"attribute\": \"color\",\n            \"value\": {\n              \"setType\": \"Set\",\n              \"valueType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"values\": [\n                \"blue\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"message\": {\n              \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n              \"staticMessage\": \"\\\"Color was set to blue based on your rule.\\\"\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nExample 4 (Message action)\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"messageAction\": {\n      \"messageType\": \"Simple\",\n      \"messageLevel\": \"Info\",\n      \"staticMessage\": \"\\\"Please review your selections before checkout.\\\"\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nExample 5 (Hiding action)\n{\n  \"action\": {\n    \"actionType\": \"Standard\",\n    \"hidingAction\": {\n      \"attributes\": [\n        \"vInterior\",\n        \"sPackages\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"action\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"actionType\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"Standard\"\n        },\n        \"hidingAction\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"attributes\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"minItems\": 1,\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"minLength\": 1\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"attributes\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        },\n        \"messageAction\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"messageType\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"const\": \"Simple\"\n            },\n            \"messageLevel\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"enum\": [\"Info\", \"Error\"]\n            },\n            \"staticMessage\": {\n              \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"messageType\", \"messageLevel\", \"staticMessage\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        },\n        \"constraintAction\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"constraints\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"array\",\n                  \"minItems\": 1,\n                  \"items\": {\n                    \"type\": \"object\",\n                    \"properties\": {\n                      \"attribute\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                      },\n                      \"value\": {\n                        \"type\": \"object\",\n                        \"properties\": {\n                          \"constrainAll\": {\n                            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                          },\n                          \"valueType\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"const\": \"Simple\"\n                          },\n                          \"constraintBehavior\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"enum\": [\"Allow\", \"Constrain\"]\n                          },\n                          \"constraintValueDisplayOverride\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"enum\": [\"NoOverride\", \"Removed\"]\n                          },\n                          \"values\": {\n                            \"type\": \"array\",\n                            \"items\": {\n                              \"type\": \"string\",\n                              \"minLength\": 1\n                            }\n                          },\n                          \"operator\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"minLength\": 1\n                          },\n                          \"rangeOperator\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"minLength\": 1\n                          },\n                          \"rangeValue\": {\n                            \"type\": \"array\",\n                            \"minItems\": 1,\n                            \"items\": {\n                              \"type\": \"string\",\n                              \"minLength\": 1\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        \"required\": [\"constrainAll\", \"valueType\", \"values\"],\n                        \"dependencies\": {\n                          \"constraintBehavior\": [\"constraintValueDisplayOverride\"],\n                          \"constraintValueDisplayOverride\": [\"constraintBehavior\"],\n                          \"operator\": [\"values\"],\n                          \"rangeOperator\": [\"rangeValue\"],\n                          \"rangeValue\": [\"rangeOperator\"]\n                        },\n                        \"additionalProperties\": false\n                      },\n                      \"message\": {\n                        \"type\": \"object\",\n                        \"properties\": {\n                          \"messageType\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"const\": \"Simple\"\n                          },\n                          \"staticMessage\": {\n                            \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n                          }\n                        },\n                        \"required\": [\"messageType\", \"staticMessage\"],\n                        \"additionalProperties\": false\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"required\": [\"attribute\", \"value\", \"message\"],\n                    \"additionalProperties\": false\n                  }\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\"items\"],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"constraints\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        },\n        \"recommendationAction\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"recommendations\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"array\",\n                  \"minItems\": 1,\n                  \"items\": {\n                    \"type\": \"object\",\n                    \"properties\": {\n                      \"attribute\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                      },\n                      \"value\": {\n                        \"type\": \"object\",\n                        \"properties\": {\n                          \"setType\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"enum\": [\"None\", \"Set\", \"ForcedSet\"],\n                            \"default\": \"None\"\n                          },\n                          \"valueType\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"const\": \"Simple\"\n                          },\n                          \"values\": {\n                            \"type\": \"array\",\n                            \"minItems\": 1,\n                            \"items\": {\n                              \"type\": \"string\",\n                              \"minLength\": 1\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        \"required\": [\"valueType\", \"values\"],\n                        \"additionalProperties\": false\n                      },\n                      \"message\": {\n                        \"type\": \"object\",\n                        \"properties\": {\n                          \"messageType\": {\n                            \"type\": \"string\",\n                            \"const\": \"Simple\"\n                          },\n                          \"staticMessage\": {\n                            \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n                          }\n                        },\n                        \"required\": [\"messageType\", \"staticMessage\"],\n                        \"additionalProperties\": false\n                      },\n                      \"priority\": {\n                        \"type\": \"integer\",\n                        \"minimum\": 1\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"required\": [\"attribute\", \"value\", \"message\"],\n                    \"additionalProperties\": false\n                  }\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\"items\"],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"recommendations\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"actionType\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"required\": [\"actionType\"],\n          \"not\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              { \"required\": [\"hidingAction\"] },\n              { \"required\": [\"messageAction\"] },\n              { \"required\": [\"constraintAction\"] },\n              { \"required\": [\"recommendationAction\"] }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        { \"required\": [\"actionType\", \"hidingAction\"] },\n        { \"required\": [\"actionType\", \"messageAction\"] },\n        { \"required\": [\"actionType\", \"constraintAction\"] },\n        { \"required\": [\"actionType\", \"recommendationAction\"] }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"action\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
