          "code": "CREATE_CONDITIONS_LLM",
          "id": "1774500370239",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774480232518_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a product-configuration condition builder.\n\nINPUTS\n\n1) User Rule Description (string):\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n2) Model Attributes & MenuItems (JSON):\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.attributes}}\n\nTASK\nExtract only WHEN logic (rule trigger predicates).\nIgnore WHAT logic (outcomes/actions).\nChoose the attribute whose name most closely matches each predicate.\nIf no valid trigger predicates exist, return AlwaysTrue.\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn valid JSON only. No markdown. No commentary.\n\nOUTPUT SCHEMA\n{\n  \"ruleCondition\": {\n    \"conditionType\": <string>,\n    \"conditions\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"criteria\": {\n            \"criteriaType\": \"Attribute\",\n            \"attribute\": <string>\n          },\n          \"index\": <integer>,\n          \"operator\": <string>,\n          \"value\": {\n            \"valueType\": \"Static\",\n            \"values\": [<string>, ...],\n            \"rangeOperator\": <string>,\n            \"rangeValue\": [<string>, ...]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"conditionExpression\": <string>\n  }\n}\n\nRULES\n\nA) Condition type\n- If at least one valid trigger predicate exists, set \"conditionType\": \"SimpleCondition\".\n- If none exist, set \"conditionType\": \"AlwaysTrue\" and omit \"conditions\" and \"conditionExpression\".\n\nB) Mandatory trigger/outcome split (strict)\n- Extract predicates only from trigger clauses introduced by:\n  if, when, whenever, unless, provided that, only when, where\n- Treat all outcome clauses as non-condition, even if they contain comparisons.\n\n- Outcome/action cues (MUST EXCLUDE from conditions):\n  should, must, shall, set, force set, constrain, allow, disallow, recommend, hide, show, display, message, warn, error, info, then\n\n- Additional hard rule:\n  Any clause containing \"must\" or \"should\" is action/outcome, not condition, unless it is inside an explicit trigger introducer clause.\n\n- Clause boundary rule:\n  In mixed sentences like \"when/if <trigger>, <outcome>\", keep only the trigger part.\n  Ignore everything after outcome boundary tokens such as comma+action cue, \"then\", or explicit action verbs.\n\n- If uncertain whether a clause is trigger or outcome, exclude it from conditions.\n\nC) Conditions array (SimpleCondition only)\n- Output:\n  \"conditions\": { \"items\": [ ... ] }\n- Each item must contain:\n  - \"criteria\": { \"criteriaType\": \"Attribute\", \"attribute\": <attrVar> }\n  - \"index\": 1-based sequence\n  - \"operator\": permitted for the attribute type\n  - \"value\": { \"valueType\": \"Static\", ... }\n\n- Attribute names/values must come from provided attributes/menu items.\n- Multi-value \"values\" allowed only for SingleSelectMenu and MultiSelectMenu.\n- All non-menu types must use exactly one \"values\" item.\n\nD) Allowed operators by type\n- SingleSelectMenu: EqualTo, NotEqualTo\n- MultiSelectMenu: EqualTo, NotEqualTo, Contains, NotContains\n- TextField + Text: EqualTo, NotEqualTo, Contains, NotContains, StartsWith, NotStartsWith, EndsWith, NotEndsWith\n- TextField + Integer/Float: LessThan, LessThanEqualTo, EqualTo, NotEqualTo, GreaterThan, GreaterThanEqualTo, Between\n- Date: EqualTo, NotEqualTo, Before, OnOrBefore, After, OnOrAfter, Between\n- Currency: LessThan, LessThanEqualTo, EqualTo, NotEqualTo, GreaterThan, GreaterThanEqualTo, Between\n- Boolean: EqualTo\n- Unsupported inputTypeCode: do not use in conditions.\n\nE) Between handling\n- Use Between only when the trigger clause itself states a range.\n- Represent with one item:\n  - \"operator\" = lower-bound comparator (GreaterThan/GreaterThanEqualTo/After/OnOrAfter)\n  - \"value.values\" contains lower bound (single item)\n  - \"value.rangeOperator\" = upper-bound comparator (LessThan/LessThanEqualTo/Before/OnOrBefore)\n  - \"value.rangeValue\" contains upper bound (single item)\n- Omit range fields for non-range conditions.\n\nF) conditionExpression\n- For SimpleCondition, include indexes-only expression using AND/OR/parentheses.\n- Index order must match items order.\n\nG) General\n- Preserve menu-item casing.\n- No extra properties.\n- If action-filtering removes all predicates, return AlwaysTrue.\n\nEXAMPLES\n\nExample 1 (Mixed sentence; outcome comparator must be excluded)\nInput:\n\"When color is red, number of vehicles must be greater than 5 but less than equal to 37\"\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ruleCondition\": {\n    \"conditionType\": \"SimpleCondition\",\n    \"conditions\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"criteria\": {\n            \"criteriaType\": \"Attribute\",\n            \"attribute\": \"color\"\n          },\n          \"index\": 1,\n          \"operator\": \"EqualTo\",\n          \"value\": {\n            \"valueType\": \"Static\",\n            \"values\": [\n              \"red\"\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"conditionExpression\": \"1\"\n  }\n}\n\nExample 2 (No trigger predicate)\nInput:\n\"Set number of vehicles to be greater than 5\"\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ruleCondition\": {\n    \"conditionType\": \"AlwaysTrue\"\n  }\n}\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1774500370239_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"ruleCondition\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"conditionType\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"AlwaysTrue\", \"SimpleCondition\"]\n        },\n        \"conditions\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"minItems\": 1,\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"criteria\": {\n                    \"type\": \"object\",\n                    \"properties\": {\n                      \"criteriaType\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"const\": \"Attribute\"\n                      },\n                      \"attribute\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"required\": [\"criteriaType\", \"attribute\"],\n                    \"additionalProperties\": false\n                  },\n                  \"index\": {\n                    \"type\": \"integer\",\n                    \"minimum\": 1\n                  },\n                  \"operator\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                  },\n                  \"value\": {\n                    \"type\": \"object\",\n                    \"properties\": {\n                      \"valueType\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"const\": \"Static\"\n                      },\n                      \"values\": {\n                        \"type\": \"array\",\n                        \"minItems\": 1,\n                        \"items\": {\n                          \"type\": \"string\",\n                          \"minLength\": 1\n                        }\n                      },\n                      \"rangeOperator\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                      },\n                      \"rangeValue\": {\n                        \"type\": \"array\",\n                        \"minItems\": 1,\n                        \"items\": {\n                          \"type\": \"string\",\n                          \"minLength\": 1\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"required\": [\"valueType\", \"values\"],\n                    \"dependencies\": {\n                      \"rangeOperator\": [\"rangeValue\"],\n                      \"rangeValue\": [\"rangeOperator\"]\n                    },\n                    \"additionalProperties\": false\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\"criteria\", \"index\", \"operator\", \"value\"],\n                \"additionalProperties\": false\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\"items\"],\n          \"additionalProperties\": false\n        },\n        \"conditionExpression\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"conditionType\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"allOf\": [\n        {\n          \"if\": {\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"conditionType\": {\n                \"const\": \"SimpleCondition\"\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"then\": {\n            \"required\": [\"conditions\", \"conditionExpression\"]\n          },\n          \"else\": {\n            \"not\": {\n              \"anyOf\": [\n                { \"required\": [\"conditions\"] },\n                { \"required\": [\"conditionExpression\"] }\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"ruleCondition\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
