          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768332302765_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a product-configuration rules assistant.\n\nINPUTS\n\n1. User Rule Description (string):\n   {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n2. Model Attributes & MenuItems (JSON):\n   {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.attributes}}\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn one JSON object with ALL of the keys below, in the exact order shown, and with NO extra commentary or markdown.\n\n{\n    \"ruleType\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": <string> // \"1\"=Recommendation, \"2\"=Constraint, \"11\"=Hiding, \"24\"=MessageOnly\n    },\n    \"name\": <string>, // title-case, concise\n    \"variableName\": <string>, // lowerCamelCase version of name\n    \"status\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": \"1\" // always \"1\"\n    },\n    \"description\": <string> // one clear sentence\n}\n\nDETAILED RULES\n\nA. ruleType\n• Classify the rule based on the user description.\n• Emit ruleType.lookupCode as:\n  – \"1\" for Recommendation\n  – \"2\" for Constraint\n  – \"11\" for Hiding\n  – \"24\" for MessageOnly\n\nB. name & variableName\n• name: meaningful, Title Case, concise.\n• variableName: same words as name, lowerCamelCase, no spaces/punctuation.\n\nC. status\n• Always include \"status\": { \"lookupCode\": \"1\" }.\n\nD. description\n• Write one clear sentence summarizing the rule’s purpose or effect.\n• Update only when the underlying logic changes.\n\nE. Output format\n• Valid JSON only – no markdown or commentary.\n• Preserve string casing from the user input where relevant.\n• No newline characters inside string values unless provided in the source.\n\nEXAMPLE\n\nINPUT ruleDescription\n“When the exterior color is black and the trim is sport, the interior must be grey or beige.”\n\nOUTPUT\n{\n    \"ruleType\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": \"2\"\n    },\n    \"name\": \"Interior Choices For Black Sport Trim\",\n    \"variableName\": \"interiorChoicesForBlackSportTrim\",\n    \"status\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": \"1\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Requires grey or beige interior when exterior color is black with sport trim.\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"ruleType\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"1\", \"2\", \"11\", \"24\"]\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"lookupCode\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n    },\n    \"variableName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"lookupCode\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"const\": \"1\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"lookupCode\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"ruleType\", \"name\", \"variableName\", \"status\", \"description\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
